    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "the \"small steps\" thing feels impossible though. like, what's even the point? i look at the calendar and it's just... empty. every version of my future is just more of this quiet. it feels less like a \"transition\" and more like i've just finished my part in the world and there's nothing else for me.",
